-/// AGC target speech-peak level (dBFS): the loudness a calibrated voice is driven
-/// to. Exposed to users as a 70..100% slider — the useful band — where 70% = -15
-/// dBFS and 100% = 0 dBFS (the ceiling). Default 85% (-7.5 dBFS).
-pub const AUTO_MIC_TARGET_DBFS_DEFAULT: f32 = -7.5;
